    {
      "id": "claim_00822a374808446cbb9b1c58cf32b897",
      "statement": "The checked-in regional ECS configuration (terraform/regional/ecs.tf) sets only DATABASE_URL to the literal SQLite path /data/trusted_actions.db and defines no ROSA_TA_DB_* IAM-token environment variables, so store.NewWithIAM's selection logic resolves every regional deployment to the SQLiteStore backend even though the codebase also supports an IAM-authenticated Postgres backend and a password-DSN Postgres backend.",
