      "statement": "The ROSA_TA_S3_BUCKET and ROSA_TA_S3_KEY_PREFIX environment variables set in terraform/regional/ecs.tf's container_environment populate config.Config.S3Bucket/S3KeyPrefix, but no other application code path reads those fields back out; the bucket they name is the same per-region aws_s3_bucket.app bucket that the separate Firehose audit pipeline writes to under audit-logs/ and that Terraform uses to distribute config.yaml under config/, reached through entirely unrelated code paths rather than through the app's own S3 config.",
