    {
      "id": "claim_bd8b8e63d840411cabdeae8298eeb044",
      "statement": "NewAuditLogger is mounted inside the authenticated /api/v0/trusted-actions chi route group between authnMiddleware.AuthenticateAccountJWT and authzMiddleware.AuthorizeAPI, so its deferred CreateAuditEntry write captures the final response status (including a 403 from AuthorizeAPI denying the call) and the username authentication already resolved, for every request that reaches that route group.",
