    {
      "id": "claim_49f02cfb5f6c46749f96d41dcdf2e78a",
      "statement": "Config carries two parallel database contracts resolved by store.NewWithIAM: the legacy DatabaseURL password-DSN/SQLite-path field, and an IAM-token contract (DBHost, DBPort, DBName, DBUser, DBSSLMode) with no password field, plus pool-tuning fields (DBMaxOpenConns, DBMaxIdleConns, DBConnMaxLifetime) shared by both paths and passed through as store.PostgresConfig.",
