    {
      "id": "claim_0a802e4495c94258a04e37b77f1b7884",
      "statement": "newIAMPostgresStore authenticates by minting a fresh short-lived RDS IAM database token per physical connection via a custom tokenConnector, and caps the pool's ConnMaxLifetime at 10 minutes so no pooled connection can outlive its token's roughly 15-minute validity; it otherwise returns the same *PostgresStore type as the password-DSN path and runs the same Postgres schema migrations.",
