    {
      "id": "claim_6190fe7ca8874b7c9950b357670f0467",
      "statement": "AuditEntry persistence is identical in shape across all three store backends: SQLiteStore, password-DSN PostgresStore, and IAM-token PostgresStore all implement the same store.Store interface against the same audit_entries column set defined once in internal/store/shared.go, and the choice of backend has no effect on the separate audit.Record / CloudWatch-Firehose-S3 execution-log path, which never touches the application database.",
